              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eng'ura, kelotu enkata, neewuo taata, naisardakieki intae, nelo pooki tung'ani enkang enye, naaing'uari aa nanu ake; kake mme nanu ake, amu aaboitare Papa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
